  "_comment": "Bundled font set for ASH Captions (spec 7A.4). Every entry here is a face a Style may reference, named exactly as the font file's own family name (OpenType name ID 1) -- the name libass matches on. Google serves weight variants as instanced files whose family name carries the weight ('Baloo 2 SemiBold', 'Fredoka Medium'); a style must use that full name or libass falls back to Arial. Only SIL Open Font License 1.1 and Apache License 2.0 faces are listed (Luckiest Guy and Permanent Marker are the Apache ones) -- both permit redistribution inside the installer; each family's licence text ships beside the fonts under licenses/ (fetched by the same download step). This file ships committed to the repo and needs no network access; `python -m ash_captions.styles.fonts download` fetches the matching .ttf and licence files into this directory using the same list.",
